b/ref 1071 "$\\int {x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332814 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3e19633c-fd26-592a-9173-f3506939c283" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332814 #edb/ref 1074 "We need to use integration by parts. \n\nIn this case, we define\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={x}^{2}\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =({x}^{2})(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1))-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)(2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we use integration by parts to evaluate $\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\text{d}x.$ We take\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the formula for integration by parts gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(x)(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1))-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1))(1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+D,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is an integral constant.\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2(-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+D) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)-2D \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-1)+2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=-2D.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401017 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401018 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401019 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401020 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401015 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "4d94100e-63ab-58cf-b2c0-0f485eafe140" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401016 #edb/ref 1080 "3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )+16{cos}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )}\\,\\text{d}\\theta " #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401016 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401016 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c77b2f36-6be8-50c0-ae22-868fa6cf86a1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401017 #edb/ref 1080 "3{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )+4{cos}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )}\\,\\text{d}\\theta " #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401017 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401017 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "09d3bae4-8fa4-5410-960c-88cdf9ccbafc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401018 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )+4{cos}^{2}⁡(4\\theta )}\\,\\text{d}\\theta " #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401018 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 175921860